The `molnextr/` inference module accompanies the MolNexTR integration described
in Chen et al., Journal of Cheminformatics 16, 141 (2024), DOI
10.1186/s13321-024-00926-w. Confirm its redistribution terms with the original
authors before making a public release; no separate source-code license was
present in the working copy from which it was consolidated.

This project integrates external components without redistributing their model
weights: Qwen3-VL, PEFT, DeepSpeed, SAM3, MolNexTR, RDKit, and Indigo.
Each component remains subject to its own license and model-use terms. Consult
the upstream projects before redistribution or commercial use.